Z||000026||msweldon||01-11-2001||10:21 AM||||The Kessel system is adjacent to a cluster of black holes known as the Maw, which makes navigating to the planet difficult and helped glamorize the smugglers' "Kessel Run." While Kessel was under control by the Empire it was a common smuggling destination for those dealing in spice, and Han Solo once boasted he had made the Kessel Run in "less than 12 parsecs" by flying dangerously close to the Maw. The closer Han Solo could skirt the Maw the shorter distance he had to travel, thus "he made the kessel run in less than 12 Parsecs," which was the shortest route taken up to that point.<P>mw<p>[This message has been edited by msweldon (edited 01-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000027||1FST2M6||01-11-2001||10:28 AM||||and Marc swoops in and pulls that out of his @$$!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   i've got the movies but haven't memorized them..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> good memory you got there Marc! ||||reg||1
Z||000028||mrfixit58||01-11-2001||11:29 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by msweldon:<BR><B>The Kessel system is adjacent to a cluster of black holes known as the Maw, which makes navigating to the planet difficult and helped glamorize the smugglers' "Kessel Run." While Kessel was under control by the Empire it was a common smuggling destination for those dealing in spice, and Han Solo once boasted he had made the Kessel Run in "less than 12 parsecs" by flying dangerously close to the Maw. The closer Han Solo could skirt the Maw the shorter distance he had to travel, thus "he made the kessel run in less than 12 Parsecs," which was the short route take up to that point.<P>mw</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Now THAT is a fan!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> That info didn't come from the movie!<P>Roy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by mrfixit58 (edited 01-12-2001).]||||reg||14
